    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>现在这篇文章里的函数图像<strong>是可以交互的</strong> —— 滚轮缩放、拖动平移,3D 的还能拖着转。这篇讲怎么做的,以及为什么最后没有用 plotly 或 three.js。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="先看效果"><a href="#先看效果" class="headerlink" title="先看效果"></a>先看效果</h2><p>一条普通的三角函数,拖一下、滚一下都行:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 条曲线</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":[]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-7,7],"y":[-2.2,2.2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>sin(x)</pre></details></div><p>同一张图里画多条曲线,自动配不同颜色、自动适配 y 范围:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 2 条曲线</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)/x","constraints":[]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"cos(x)","constraints":[]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-6.5,6.5],"y":null,"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>sin(x)/xcos(x)</pre></details></div><p>3D 的曲面麻烦一点,因为要自己算投影、自己排序。<strong>按住拖动可以转</strong>:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 曲面 · z = sin(sqrt(x^2+y^2))</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(sqrt(x^2+y^2))","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-5,5],"y":[-5,5],"z":null,"grid":54,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>sin(sqrt(x^2+y^2))</pre></details></div><p>这个经典的高斯钟形曲面,换个角度看形状更清楚:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 曲面 · z = exp(-(x^2+y^2)/2)</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"exp(-(x^2+y^2)/2)","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-3,3],"y":[-3,3],"z":null,"grid":54,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>exp(-(x^2+y^2)/2)</pre></details></div><p>再来个会”打架”的:两个方向的波叠加,转起来看干涉条纹:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 曲面 · z = sin(x)*cos(y)</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)*cos(y)","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-6,6],"y":[-6,6],"z":null,"grid":64,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>sin(x)*cos(y)</pre></details></div><h2 id="为什么不用现成的库"><a href="#为什么不用现成的库" class="headerlink" title="为什么不用现成的库"></a>为什么不用现成的库</h2><p>第一反应当然是引库。plotly.js 什么都有,three.js 渲染 3D 也漂亮。但算下来不划算:</p><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>plotly.js</th><th>three.js</th><th>自己写</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>体积</td><td>2D 约 1 MB,3D 再加 1.3 MB</td><td>约 600 KB</td><td><strong>约 26 KB</strong></td></tr><tr><td>依赖</td><td>无,但很大</td><td>需要自己写曲面 + 控制器</td><td>无</td></tr><tr><td>国内 CDN</td><td>要能访问,否则得塞进仓库</td><td>同左</td><td>不涉及</td></tr><tr><td>能不能验证</td><td>只能”看起来对”</td><td>同左</td><td><strong>数学核心可以在 Node 里跑单测</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>最后一条是关键。我没法在这个环境里打开浏览器看效果,引库的话就只能靠运气;而自己写的话,表达式解析、网格生成、投影、深度排序这些都是纯函数,<strong>可以写成单元测试跑一遍</strong>(这份代码有 49 项测试)。</p><p>3D 也没用 WebGL,而是 <strong>Canvas 2D + 画家算法</strong>:算出每个四边形四个顶点的屏幕坐标,按深度从远到近排序,依次填充。对 <code>z = f(x,y)</code> 这种单值高度场,画家算法几乎不会出错,而且避开了 WebGL 上下文丢失、移动端兼容这些麻烦。代价是网格密度不能太高,默认 46×46。</p><h2 id="几个实现细节"><a href="#几个实现细节" class="headerlink" title="几个实现细节"></a>几个实现细节</h2><p><strong>1. 数学的 <code>^</code> 不是 JS 的 <code>^</code>。</strong> 我第一版直接把表达式编译成 JS 字符串,结果 <code>x^2</code> 被当成按位异或,<code>3^2</code> 算出来是 1 而不是 9。必须显式转成 <code>Math.pow</code>。这个 bug 是单测抓出来的 —— 肉眼根本看不出来,因为图还是”有东西”的,只是完全不对。</p><p><strong>2. 旋转矩阵的顺序。</strong> 方位角必须绕”向上”的那根轴转。我第一版把竖直方向混进了水平旋转里,效果是画面在原地打滚。测试里专门验证了:绕竖轴转 90° 后,<code>x=1</code> 的点应该跑到 <code>z=-1</code>,而高度不变。</p><p><strong>3. 隐式乘法。</strong> <code>2x</code>、<code>3sin(x)</code>、<code>(x+1)(x-1)</code> 都能认。写法上和显式乘法同级,所以 <code>2x^2 = 2·(x²)</code> 而不是 <code>(2x)²</code>。</p><p><strong>4. 未知符号明确报错。</strong> 打错一个字母时,与其给你一张空图,不如直接说”未知符号: xx”。而且<strong>构建期就会检查一遍</strong> —— 表达式写错了,<code>npm run build</code> 的日志里当场报出来,不用等打开网页。</p><p><strong>5. <code>1/x</code> 在 0 附近要断开。</strong> 非有限值处直接断开路径,否则会连出一条竖直的假线。</p><h2 id="怎么用"><a href="#怎么用" class="headerlink" title="怎么用"></a>怎么用</h2><p>在文章里写一个带 <code>plot2d</code> &#x2F; <code>plot3d</code> 标记的代码块就行:</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="code">```plot2d x=[-7,7] y=[-2,2]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">sin(x)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">cos(x)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>表达式一行一个,<code>#</code> 开头的行会被忽略(可以当注释)。</p><p><strong>可用选项:</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>选项</th><th>默认</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>x=[a,b]</code></td><td>2D <code>[-10,10]</code> &#x2F; 3D <code>[-5,5]</code></td><td>横轴范围</td></tr><tr><td><code>y=[a,b]</code></td><td>2D 自动适配 &#x2F; 3D <code>[-5,5]</code></td><td>纵轴范围(3D 时是第二个自变量)</td></tr><tr><td><code>z=[a,b]</code></td><td>自动</td><td>3D 颜色映射的高度范围</td></tr><tr><td><code>grid=n</code></td><td>46</td><td>3D 网格密度,最高 90</td></tr><tr><td><code>n=n</code></td><td>900</td><td>2D 采样点数</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>支持的函数:</strong> <code>sin</code> <code>cos</code> <code>tan</code> <code>asin</code> <code>acos</code> <code>atan</code> <code>sinh</code> <code>cosh</code> <code>tanh</code> <code>exp</code> <code>log</code> <code>ln</code> <code>log2</code> <code>log10</code> <code>sqrt</code> <code>cbrt</code> <code>abs</code> <code>sign</code> <code>floor</code> <code>ceil</code> <code>round</code> <code>min</code> <code>max</code> <code>pow</code> <code>hypot</code> <code>mod</code> <code>clamp</code>,以及两个我自己加的 <code>sinc(x)</code> 和 <code>gauss(x, σ)</code>。常量有 <code>pi</code> <code>e</code> <code>tau</code>。</p><h2 id="还支持隐式方程"><a href="#还支持隐式方程" class="headerlink" title="还支持隐式方程"></a>还支持隐式方程</h2><p>前面画的都是 <code>y = f(x)</code> 这种”显式”函数。但圆锥曲线、球面这类东西写成 <code>f(x,y)=0</code> 要自然得多,所以也支持了。</p><p><strong>只要式子里有等号,就按隐式方程处理。</strong> 圆锥曲线三兄弟:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 3 个方程</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 = 1","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2/4 + y^2 = 2","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2/2 - y^2 = 1","constraints":[]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-3,3],"y":[-3,3],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 = 1x^2/4 + y^2 = 2x^2/2 - y^2 = 1</pre></details></div><p>注意画布会自动变成<strong>正方形</strong>,而且纵轴默认取和横轴一样宽 —— 不然圆会被压成椭圆。这一条很容易被忽略:隐式曲线必须横纵等比例才是它本来的形状。</p><p>球面,拖一下就能看清是个球:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":34,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1</pre></details></div><p>环面 —— 四次方程,<code>(x²+y²+z²+R²)² = 4R²(x²+y²)</code>:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · (x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 0.6)^2 = 4*(x^2 + y^2)</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 0.6)^2 = 4*(x^2 + y^2)","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-2.4,2.4],"y":[-2.4,2.4],"z":[-2.4,2.4],"grid":36,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>(x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 0.6)^2 = 4*(x^2 + y^2)</pre></details></div><p>显式和隐式还能混在同一张图里:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 条曲线 + 1 个方程</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 = 4","constraints":[]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":[]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-4,4],"y":[-4,4],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 = 4sin(x)</pre></details></div><p>一张图里还能叠<strong>多个</strong>曲面&#x2F;等值面。下面这个是正四面体四个顶点上各放一个球,两两相切(球心间距正好是 <code>2r</code>):</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D · 4 个曲面 · 半透明 62% · 4 个点</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"(x-1)^2+y^2+z^2=3/4","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"(x+1/2)^2+(y-sqrt(3)/2)^2+z^2=3/4","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"(x+1/2)^2+(y+sqrt(3)/2)^2+z^2=3/4","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2+y^2+(z-sqrt(2))^2=3/4","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":0,"y":0,"z":1.4142135623730951,"label":"A","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":1,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"B","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":-0.5,"y":0.8660254037844386,"z":0,"label":"C","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":-0.5,"y":-0.8660254037844386,"z":0,"label":"D","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-4,4],"y":[-4,4],"z":[-4,4],"grid":34,"alpha":0.62}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>point(0, 0, sqrt(2)) Apoint(1, 0, 0) Bpoint(-1/2, sqrt(3)/2, 0) Cpoint(-1/2, -sqrt(3)/2, 0) D(x-1)^2+y^2+z^2=3/4(x+1/2)^2+(y-sqrt(3)/2)^2+z^2=3/4(x+1/2)^2+(y+sqrt(3)/2)^2+z^2=3/4x^2+y^2+(z-sqrt(2))^2=3/4</pre></details></div><p>多曲面时<strong>按曲面轮流换色</strong>(而不是按高度渐变),一眼能看出哪块是哪个式子。</p><h3 id="半透明"><a href="#半透明" class="headerlink" title="半透明"></a>半透明</h3><p>四个球叠在一起,如果全是不透明的,前面的球会把后面的挡掉大半。所以<strong>多个曲面默认就是半透明的</strong>,工具条上那个「半透明」按钮可以来回切。</p><p>也可以自己指定透明度(0.05 ~ 1):</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D · 2 个曲面 · 半透明 35%</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":[]},{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 3","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":32,"alpha":0.35}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 3</pre></details></div><p><code>alpha=</code> 越小越透。单个曲面默认不透明(实心的球好看),想要玻璃球写 <code>alpha=0.5</code> 就行。</p><p>半透明不是”整张图统一压一个 alpha”那么简单 —— 那样只能看到球正面那一层,背面被同色的正面盖住,反而没有透明的感觉。这里的做法是<strong>每个四边形各自带 alpha、按深度从远到近画</strong>,所以近处的面会真的和远处的面叠在一起。</p><p>代价是不能再靠”同色描边”去压相邻面之间的缝了(每条棱都会再叠一层 alpha,整张网格线会浮出来),所以半透明时改成把每个面从重心往外撑开 0.6 像素,让相邻面互相咬住。另外半透明时着色也会少压暗一点,不然深色背景下几乎看不见。</p><h3 id="两种方程背后是两套完全不同的算法"><a href="#两种方程背后是两套完全不同的算法" class="headerlink" title="两种方程背后是两套完全不同的算法"></a>两种方程背后是两套完全不同的算法</h3><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>显式</th><th>隐式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2D</td><td>逐点采样,连成折线</td><td><strong>marching squares</strong>:在每个小格上看四角正负号,在符号变化的边上插值出交点再连起来</td></tr><tr><td>3D</td><td>生成高度场网格</td><td><strong>surface nets</strong>:每个”有符号变化”的立方体格子里放一个顶点,再对每条有符号变化的网格棱拼一个四边形</td></tr></tbody></table><p>3D 隐式这块本来该用经典的 <strong>marching cubes</strong>,但它需要一张 256 项、每项最多 16 个索引的查找表 —— 手抄这种东西错一个数字就会在某些角度冒出一块诡异的面。<strong>surface nets</strong> 不需要任何查找表,代码短得多,而且产出的正好是四边形,能直接喂给现有的画家算法渲染器。</p><p>两个算法都有个容易翻车的点:</p><ul><li><strong>marching squares 的鞍点</strong>。一个格子里出现 4 个交点时(比如 <code>f = x·y</code> 在原点附近),必须看<strong>格子中心</strong>的正负号才能决定该”上下连”还是”左右连”。省掉这一步,双曲线在某些位置会出现莫名其妙的交叉连线。</li><li><strong>surface nets 的边界</strong>。曲面如果正好贴到包围盒的面上,那一圈会缺几个面片。把范围开大一点就好。</li></ul><h3 id="选项上的区别"><a href="#选项上的区别" class="headerlink" title="选项上的区别"></a>选项上的区别</h3><p>隐式 3D 需要三个轴的范围,所以 <code>z=</code> 在隐式下表示<strong>第三个坐标轴</strong>,而显式下表示颜色映射的高度范围:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":[]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":34,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1</pre></details></div><p><code>grid</code> 对隐式 3D 建议不要开太高(默认 32):曲面网格的四边形数量是显式高度场的好几倍,开太高拖动会掉帧。</p><h2 id="约束条件-把图形裁成你想要的那一块"><a href="#约束条件-把图形裁成你想要的那一块" class="headerlink" title="约束条件:把图形裁成你想要的那一块"></a>约束条件:把图形裁成你想要的那一块</h2><p><strong>只要一行里出现 <code>&lt;</code> <code>&gt;</code> <code>&lt;=</code> <code>&gt;=</code>,它就自动被当成约束条件</strong> —— 约束会裁掉其他所有图形(曲线、方程、曲面)落在区域外的部分。不需要什么新语法。</p><p>上半球,一行搞定:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 · 1 个全局约束</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":["z > 0"]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":34,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1z &gt; 0</pre></details></div><p>约束是组合的,写几行就叠几层。下面这个球被两个半空间同时切:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 · 2 个全局约束</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":["z > 0","x + y \u003c 0"]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":32,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1z &gt; 0x + y &lt; 0</pre></details></div><p>2D 也一样。单位圆上 <code>x &lt; y</code> 的那段弧:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 个方程 + 1 个全局约束</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 = 1","constraints":["x \u003c y"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 = 1x &lt; y</pre></details></div><h3 id="只写约束条件-画区域"><a href="#只写约束条件-画区域" class="headerlink" title="只写约束条件 &#x3D; 画区域"></a>只写约束条件 &#x3D; 画区域</h3><p>如果一个 2D 代码块里<strong>只有约束条件</strong>,那就画满足条件的区域(填充 + 描边):</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 区域</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[],"region":["x^2 + y^2 \u003c 1"],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 &lt; 1</pre></details></div><p>几个区域叠起来就是交集 —— 比如”单位圆内且第一象限”:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 区域</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[],"region":["x^2 + y^2 \u003c 1","x > 0","y > 0"],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 &lt; 1x &gt; 0y &gt; 0</pre></details></div><h3 id="约束是怎么实现的"><a href="#约束是怎么实现的" class="headerlink" title="约束是怎么实现的"></a>约束是怎么实现的</h3><table><thead><tr><th>图形</th><th>裁剪方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>显式 2D 曲线</td><td>采样时逐点判定,不满足就<strong>断开折线</strong></td></tr><tr><td>隐式 2D 等值线</td><td>线段两端都必须满足约束才保留</td></tr><tr><td>3D 高度场</td><td>网格点标成空值,引用它的四边形自动消失</td></tr><tr><td>3D 等值面</td><td>顶点在约束外就不生成,四边形自然消失</td></tr><tr><td>区域</td><td>逐个格子判定中心是否满足,满足的格子并成一个路径一次填充</td></tr></tbody></table><p>区域填充有个小细节:所有格子必须<strong>塞进同一条路径再 fill</strong>。如果一格一格地 fill,格子相邻处会因为两次半透明叠加而出现明显的网格接缝。</p><p>内部实现上,四种比较符号统一归一化成 <code>g &gt; 0</code> &#x2F; <code>g &gt;= 0</code>(<code>a &lt; b</code> 就变成 <code>b - a &gt; 0</code>),判定逻辑只剩一个符号问题。</p><blockquote><p>注意比较符号的识别顺序:<code>&lt;=</code> &#x2F; <code>&gt;=</code> 必须排在 <code>&lt;</code> &#x2F; <code>&gt;</code> 前面 —— 否则 <code>x &lt;= y</code> 会被当成 <code>&lt;</code> 后面跟了个 <code>=</code>。</p></blockquote><h2 id="单独的点"><a href="#单独的点" class="headerlink" title="单独的点"></a>单独的点</h2><p>用 <code>point(x, y)</code> 或 <code>point(x, y, z)</code>,后面可以跟一个标签:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 条曲线 + 3 个点</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"O","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":1.5707963267948966,"y":1,"z":0,"label":"A","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":3.141592653589793,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"B","constraints":[]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-4,4],"y":[-1.6,1.6],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>y = sin(x)point(0, 0) Opoint(pi/2, 1) Apoint(pi, 0) B</pre></details></div><p>坐标是<strong>常量表达式</strong>,所以 <code>pi/2</code>、<code>sqrt(2)</code> 都能直接写。点也会被约束条件管 —— 在约束外的点不会画出来:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 · 1 个全局约束 · 4 个点</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":["z >= 0"]},{"type":"point","x":1,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"X","constraints":["z >= 0"]},{"type":"point","x":0,"y":1,"z":0,"label":"Y","constraints":["z >= 0"]},{"type":"point","x":0,"y":0,"z":1,"label":"Z","constraints":["z >= 0"]},{"type":"point","x":0,"y":0,"z":-1,"label":"看不见","constraints":["z >= 0"]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":30,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1z &gt;= 0point(1, 0, 0) Xpoint(0, 1, 0) Ypoint(0, 0, 1) Zpoint(0, 0, -1) 看不见</pre></details></div><p><strong>边界上写 <code>&gt;</code> 还是 <code>&gt;=</code> 会差很多。</strong> 上面如果写成 <code>z &gt; 0</code>,虽然球面看起来差不多,但<strong>赤道上的 X 和 Y(它们的 z 正好是 0)会被一起排除掉</strong>,四个点只剩一个。曲面本身和约束的边界相交时,严格的 <code>&gt;</code> 会把整条交线切掉,<code>&gt;=</code> 才会留下。</p><p><strong>3D 的点会和曲面一起按深度排序</strong>,所以球背面的点会被球正确地挡住,而不是浮在最上面。半径也随透视缩放,靠近时自然变大。</p><h3 id="给每条曲线单独定制约束"><a href="#给每条曲线单独定制约束" class="headerlink" title="给每条曲线单独定制约束"></a>给每条曲线单独定制约束</h3><p>上面那种独立成行的约束是<strong>全局</strong>的,会把这张图里所有东西一起裁。但很多时候你想要的恰恰相反 —— 比如”这条只画右半边,那条只画左半边”。</p><p>用 <code>where</code> 跟在这一行后面就行:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 2 条曲线 + 2 条带 where</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":["x >= 0"]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"cos(x)","constraints":["x \u003c 0"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-7,7],"y":[-1.6,1.6],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>y = sin(x) where x &gt;= 0y = cos(x) where x &lt; 0</pre></details></div><p>多个条件用 <code>and</code> 连接(<code>&amp;&amp;</code> 也可以):</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 2 条曲线 + 2 条带 where</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":["x > -4","y > 0"]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"cos(x)","constraints":["x > 2"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-7,7],"y":[-1.6,1.6],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>y = sin(x) where x &gt; -4 and y &gt; 0y = cos(x) where x &gt; 2</pre></details></div><p>隐式方程、3D 曲面同样支持:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 条曲线 + 1 个方程 + 1 条带 where</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 = 1","constraints":[]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"x","constraints":["x^2 + y^2 > 1"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 = 1y = x where x^2 + y^2 &gt; 1</pre></details></div><div class="plot" data-kind="3d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">3D 等值面 · x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 · 带 where</span>    <span class="plot-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="alpha" aria-pressed="false">半透明</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1","constraints":["z > 0"]}],"opts":{"x":[-2,2],"y":[-2,2],"z":[-2,2],"grid":34,"alpha":1}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 where z &gt; 0</pre></details></div><h3 id="全局和局部是叠加的-不是覆盖"><a href="#全局和局部是叠加的-不是覆盖" class="headerlink" title="全局和局部是叠加的,不是覆盖"></a>全局和局部是<strong>叠加</strong>的,不是覆盖</h3><p>不带 <code>where</code> 的独立约束行仍然全局生效,它会被并进每一条的约束里:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount>  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 2 条曲线 + 1 个全局约束 + 1 条带 where</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"explicit","expr":"sin(x)","constraints":["x >= -2","y > 0"]},{"type":"explicit","expr":"cos(x)","constraints":["x >= -2"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-4,4],"y":[-2,2],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x &gt;= -2y = sin(x) where y &gt; 0y = cos(x)</pre></details></div><p>上面这张图的实际效果是:</p><table><thead><tr><th>曲线</th><th>实际生效的约束</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>sin(x)</code></td><td><code>x &gt;= -2</code> <strong>且</strong> <code>y &gt; 0</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>cos(x)</code></td><td><code>x &gt;= -2</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>也就是<strong>先按整张图的限制裁一遍,再按各自的 <code>where</code> 裁一遍</strong>。这个语义比”有 where 就无视全局”更可预测 —— 全局约束的意思是”这张图整体只看这一块”,不该被某一条曲线悄悄绕过。</p><h3 id="每个点也可以有自己的约束"><a href="#每个点也可以有自己的约束" class="headerlink" title="每个点也可以有自己的约束"></a>每个点也可以有自己的约束</h3><p><code>where</code> 对点同样有效,而且标签和 <code>where</code> 可以同时写:</p><div class="plot" data-kind="2d" data-mount data-ratio="1">  <div class="plot-bar">    <span class="plot-kind">2D · 1 个方程 + 2 个点</span>    <span class="plot-hint">滚轮缩放 · 拖动平移 · 双击重置</span>    <span class="plot-actions">      <button type="button" data-plot-action="reset">重置</button>      <button type="button" data-plot-action="save">存为 PNG</button>    </span>  </div>  <div class="plot-stage"><canvas></canvas></div>  <script type="application/json">{"items":[{"type":"implicit","expr":"x^2 + y^2 = 4","constraints":[]},{"type":"point","x":2,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"在圆上","constraints":["x > 0"]},{"type":"point","x":-2,"y":0,"z":0,"label":"这个看不到","constraints":["x > 0"]}],"region":[],"opts":{"x":[-3,3],"y":[-3,3],"samples":900}}</script>  <details class="plot-src"><summary>表达式</summary><pre>x^2 + y^2 = 4point(2, 0) 在圆上 where x &gt; 0point(-2, 0) 这个看不到 where x &gt; 0</pre></details></div><p>第二个点虽然画在 <code>x = -2</code> 的圆上,但被自己的 <code>where x &gt; 0</code> 排除了,不会出现。</p><h2 id="交互"><a href="#交互" class="headerlink" title="交互"></a>交互</h2><ul><li><strong>2D</strong>:滚轮缩放(以鼠标位置为锚点)、拖动平移、双击重置</li><li><strong>3D</strong>:拖动旋转、滚轮缩放、双击重置</li><li><strong>触屏</strong>:单指拖动、双指捏合缩放</li><li>右上角有「重置」和「存为 PNG」—— 写作业要用图的话直接存下来</li><li><strong>3D</strong> 还有「半透明」开关:球套球、多个曲面互相遮挡的时候按一下就能看穿</li></ul><p>绘制代码只在<strong>含图像的页面</strong>加载,其他页面完全不受影响。</p>]]>
    </content>
